@0x4007 I know this was discussed previously and the "text field" can handle searching for a repo, but as an avid user of `work.ubq.fi` the lack of easy org filters actually bothers me a lot. I have implemented a pretty solution in around 4 hours, please give it a look.
[orgsSelector.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57013b8f-174b-433d-b12e-34685b5ad37b)
If you like it lmk so I can put in more effort to polish and wrap it up. Open to feedbacks.

